WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,630
Someone coming

2
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:03,360
Stand up and warn those who oppose joining the military.

3
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:05,120
Settlement fee for each person is ten taels of silver

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,080
Dun Dun Guan Bao

5
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,120
Have you heard about it?

6
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,960
Dingyuan Line Military Department opens warehouse to recruit troops

7
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,560
Just nod and draw the pledge to join the army

8
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,280
When thinking of silver

9
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,200
Take this seriously

10
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,920
If you don't capture strong soldiers these days, you'll be burning incense.

11
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,080
It’s absolutely true that real money and silver will be given out.

12
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:18,280
I have just sent people specially since I was a child

13
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:20,000
Burn the money, come back and leave quickly

14
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,620
Once the trip is over, all the money will be distributed. According to this progress, it will be repaid in a few days.

15
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,180
How about a certain family being able to raise an army of 100,000?

16
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,180
Accept or not

17
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:31,580
Someone has already said it

18
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,500
A certain family is born with talented civil servants

19
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,740
The king will perform the ten beads

20
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,140
Let a certain family beat the second one

21
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:41,280
That's Brother Shuntian Ying Renguo

22
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:43,280
My heart is bigger than the empty treasury that can run away like a mouse

23
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,520
Where did the silver that Brother Li recruited come from?

24
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,560
Brother Zhang doesn’t know something

25
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:48,280
Brother Li followed me to overthrow the capital of King Qi

26
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:50,440
I walked away with a whole bag of Western treasures at Qi Wang Palace

27
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:53,080
I think I sold some casually and exchanged them for cash for us to recruit troops.

28
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:55,680
It's about serving the family and defending the country with great righteousness. Brother Li recruits troops.

29
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,320
When you go up, you look white and have a mixed face. Really?

30
00:00:58,360 --> 00:01:00,360
Vulgar and crude, but powerful enough to work miracles

31
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:01,320
How many days have passed

32
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,520
The Ministry of War heard a lot of things

33
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,200
Recruiting troops is even more difficult than recruiting troops

34
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,760
Write a letter here and come to see me today

35
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:06,960
He must not be able to bear the suffering of civil servants
